      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Occupational bronchial asthma patients appeared to have various serum levels of Tumor Necrosis Factor alpha before initiation of phytotherapy complexes treatment. After taking phytotherapy complexes the levels of TNF-alpha normalized. That caused lower incidence of occupational bronchial asthma exacerbations and longer remission periods."},
